# {{lb|zh|emphasis on subject}} [[even]]
#: {{zh-x|我 都 不 知道，你 是 怎麼 知道 的？|How come you know it when even I don't know?}}
# {{lb|zh|emphasis on object}} [[even]], interchangeable with {{l|zh|也|tr=yě}}
#: {{zh-x|我 身上 一 分 錢 都 沒有。|I don't even have a single cent.}}
#: {{zh-x|我 給 她 打 了 四 個 電話，她 一個 都 沒 接。|I called her four times, but she answered none of them.}}
## {{lb|zh|emphasis}} {{n-g|Used in the {{lang|zh|[[連]]……都……}} structure; interchangeable with {{l|zh|也|tr=yě}}}}; [[even]]
##: {{zh-x|他 '''連''' 畜{chù}生{sheng} '''都''' 不如，'''連''' 自己 的 父母 '''都''' 不 養活{huo}。|He is no better than an animal, because he doesn't even support his own parents.}}
# {{lb|zh|emphasis on verb|in the negative}} [[at all]]
#: {{zh-x|睇 都 未 睇 過|have not seen a single second of it; have not seen it '''at all'''|C}}
# [[already]]
#: {{zh-x|都 四 點 了。|It is '''already''' 4 o'clock.}}
#: {{zh-x|都 這麼 晚 了 嗎？|Is it that late '''already'''?}}
